WEBVTT

00:11.590 --> 00:13.300
<b>-[man 1] What the--?
-[man 2] What?</b>

00:13.380 --> 00:16.680
<b>-[overlapping murmurs]
-[heavy footfalls approaching]</b>

00:28.270 --> 00:29.570
<b>[groaning]</b>

00:30.780 --> 00:32.530
<b>You think he's dead?</b>

00:32.610 --> 00:37.530
<b>I think you're only carrying
35.62% of his weight.</b>

00:38.030 --> 00:38.950
<b>Pick it up.</b>

00:41.080 --> 00:42.330
<b>Teamwork makes the dream</b>

00:42.410 --> 00:44.710
<b>a slightly greater
statistical probability!</b>

00:44.790 --> 00:47.960
<b>Someone really ought
to rewire those circuits for you.</b>

00:48.540 --> 00:50.630
<b>These are professionals?</b>

00:50.710 --> 00:53.720
<b>They want to kill each other
at the slightest provocation,</b>

00:53.800 --> 00:55.090
<b>like little children.</b>

00:55.180 --> 00:58.390
<b>[chuckles] Do little children
kill each other a lot in Russia?</b>

00:58.890 --> 00:59.720
<b>Yes.</b>

01:09.230 --> 01:11.230
<b>[overlapping indistinct chatter]</b>

01:11.320 --> 01:13.320
<b>[panting]</b>

01:16.320 --> 01:20.240
<b>[priest]
Hush, now. My lambs have gathered.</b>

01:24.330 --> 01:25.160
<b>Yassan.</b>

01:25.710 --> 01:31.500
<b>Honest people, as a man of the cloth,
it is my duty and burden to bring you</b>

01:31.590 --> 01:34.010
<b>this most tragic news.</b>

01:34.090 --> 01:37.260
<b>There was a woman
who recently stayed among you.</b>

01:37.340 --> 01:38.510
<b>A singer.</b>

01:39.260 --> 01:40.930
<b>You mean the singer from the bar?</b>

01:41.430 --> 01:42.430
<b>Ichika?</b>

01:42.510 --> 01:45.480
<b>She's been missing.
I used to go see her every night.</b>

01:45.560 --> 01:47.270
<b>[scoffs] You sure did.</b>

01:47.350 --> 01:48.650
<b>Saki's mom!</b>

01:48.730 --> 01:52.400
<b>[priest] It is with a heavy heart
that I inform you,</b>

01:52.480 --> 01:56.610
<b>she has passed on
from this mortal plane of sin.</b>

01:56.690 --> 02:00.700
<b>And here lies the soul responsible.</b>

02:00.780 --> 02:03.080
<b>The man you know as Yassan…</b>

02:03.160 --> 02:05.620
<b>-[man in crowd] No!
-…the Black boatsman,</b>

02:05.700 --> 02:06.790
<b>is a murderer.</b>

02:06.870 --> 02:08.540
<b>-[gasps]
-[man in crowd] No way.</b>

02:08.620 --> 02:09.750
<b>[soft gasps]</b>

02:09.830 --> 02:12.170
<b>[man] I don't know. I don't think so.</b>

02:12.250 --> 02:14.050
<b>This guy might be crazier than you.</b>

02:14.130 --> 02:16.010
<b>[whirring, light beeping]</b>

02:16.090 --> 02:18.420
<b>Calculating comparative sanity.</b>

02:18.970 --> 02:19.800
<b>[sighs]</b>

02:19.880 --> 02:22.720
<b>I-I told you we should have never trusted
the foreigner.</b>

02:22.800 --> 02:25.680
<b>-Oh! But you trust this foreigner?
-[Ichiro] Liar!</b>

02:25.770 --> 02:27.060
<b>-[gasping]
-[man] What?</b>

02:27.140 --> 02:29.560
<b>Yassan isn't a murderer. He has honor.</b>

02:30.190 --> 02:33.020
<b>[chuckling]
Would that we were all so innocent.</b>

02:33.110 --> 02:35.780
<b>And he's gonna whup your pale ghost butt.</b>

02:36.360 --> 02:38.950
<b>I have proof of the boatsman's guilt.</b>

02:42.490 --> 02:43.780
<b>[gasps]</b>

02:43.870 --> 02:45.540
<b>The singer's necklace.</b>

02:45.620 --> 02:47.040
<b>She never takes it off.</b>

02:47.120 --> 02:50.920
<b>Until this demonic creature
ripped it from her neck</b>

02:51.000 --> 02:53.920
<b>as he strangled the life out of her.</b>

02:54.000 --> 02:54.880
<b>[murmuring]</b>

02:54.960 --> 02:56.840
<b>-[man 1] No way.
-[man 2] It can't be.</b>

02:56.920 --> 02:58.670
<b>-[man 1] Really?
-[man 2] No.</b>

02:59.590 --> 03:00.430
<b>[grunting]</b>

03:05.100 --> 03:10.640
<b>Ichika's child is still out there
in the wilderness, scared and alone.</b>

03:11.140 --> 03:14.190
<b>I humbly beg
your assistance in finding her.</b>

03:14.270 --> 03:17.190
<b>So long as they know
we're not splitting the reward.</b>

03:17.280 --> 03:20.200
<b>[priest] My ministry
will provide for her care.</b>

03:20.280 --> 03:23.360
<b>As for the damned soul of the guilty,</b>

03:23.450 --> 03:28.870
<b>I will see that he is brought
before God and cleansed.</b>

03:32.920 --> 03:34.830
<b>Is it true? Did you--</b>

03:34.920 --> 03:36.250
<b>Leave here.</b>

03:37.340 --> 03:38.340
<b>Forget me.</b>

03:39.130 --> 03:40.380
<b>[gasping]</b>

03:42.880 --> 03:44.300
<b>[grunts, huffs]</b>

03:48.680 --> 03:49.600
<b>[panting]</b>

03:49.680 --> 03:52.060
<b>-[crying]
-[crowd murmuring]</b>

04:02.900 --> 04:04.820
<b>["Black Gold"
by Flying Lotus playing]</b>

04:04.910 --> 04:08.370
<b>♪ Brought in a world ♪</b>

04:09.040 --> 04:14.540
<b>♪ World so brand new
Endless possibilities ♪</b>

04:15.830 --> 04:19.710
<b>♪ A whole new identity ♪</b>

04:20.210 --> 04:22.470
<b>♪ Can't you see? ♪</b>

04:23.220 --> 04:27.050
<b>♪ Black gold of the sun ♪</b>

04:27.140 --> 04:29.810
<b>♪ Open up your eyes ♪</b>

04:29.890 --> 04:32.480
<b>♪ Open up your heart ♪</b>

04:32.560 --> 04:35.400
<b>♪ And feel the sunshine ♪</b>

04:35.480 --> 04:37.810
<b>♪ Black diamond ♪</b>

04:38.310 --> 04:40.980
<b>♪ I just want to be ♪</b>

04:41.070 --> 04:43.740
<b>♪ Where I'm supposed to be ♪</b>

04:44.780 --> 04:47.410
<b>♪ And that's right here with you ♪</b>

04:59.290 --> 05:04.010
<b>♪ Don't mistake my kindness for weakness ♪</b>

05:04.090 --> 05:06.760
<b>♪ 'Cause I'm strong, you see ♪</b>

05:06.840 --> 05:09.800
<b>♪ Stronger than you'll ever be ♪</b>

05:11.760 --> 05:14.180
<b>♪ Loyal to me ♪</b>

05:14.270 --> 05:17.100
<b>♪ Someone to call my friend ♪</b>

05:17.190 --> 05:20.020
<b>♪ Whenever you need me ♪</b>

05:20.110 --> 05:22.860
<b>♪ I'll be right here ♪</b>

05:22.940 --> 05:25.240
<b>♪ Love and loyalty ♪</b>

05:25.740 --> 05:28.320
<b>♪ Trust and honesty ♪</b>

05:29.450 --> 05:31.950
<b>♪ I'll never let go ♪</b>

05:39.750 --> 05:41.750
<b>[ominous music playing]</b>

05:51.760 --> 05:52.760
<b>Wake him.</b>

05:55.890 --> 05:58.520
<b>I said wake him, not kill him.</b>

06:02.860 --> 06:03.820
<b>[Yasuke grunts]</b>

06:05.110 --> 06:06.320
<b>[weakly] I-- I did it.</b>

06:06.400 --> 06:07.650
<b>I killed her.</b>

06:08.400 --> 06:11.620
<b>His brain's scrambled worse
than the walking scrap heap.</b>

06:11.700 --> 06:14.450
<b>I don't know
what you expect us to get out of him.</b>

06:15.200 --> 06:19.420
<b>I expected you
to be able to find one little girl.</b>

06:19.960 --> 06:23.710
<b>Careful, Preacher.
You do not speak to slaves.</b>

06:23.800 --> 06:29.720
<b>No, I speak to fools, incompetents,
and an affront to God and nature!</b>

06:31.800 --> 06:33.300
<b>[robot] Target acquired.</b>

06:34.560 --> 06:36.470
<b>I will find the girl.</b>

06:36.560 --> 06:39.600
<b>The trees and birds here
speak of her passage.</b>

06:39.690 --> 06:41.020
<b>She can't hide from me.</b>

06:41.100 --> 06:45.020
<b>Go. Take this abomination with you.</b>

06:50.740 --> 06:54.160
<b>Hey, wait, am I the walking scrap heap?</b>

06:59.500 --> 07:01.500
<b>[groans softly]</b>

07:02.000 --> 07:04.000
<b>Shh. Sh, sh, sh, sh, sh, sh.</b>

07:04.090 --> 07:05.290
<b>There, there.</b>

07:05.800 --> 07:07.420
<b>Where is the girl?</b>

07:07.510 --> 07:08.840
<b>I told you.</b>

07:09.920 --> 07:11.050
<b>I don't know.</b>

07:13.890 --> 07:14.890
<b>[chains clink]</b>

07:15.600 --> 07:21.560
<b>Perfidy is the blackest of sins, and yet,
I confess I am guilty of it myself.</b>

07:21.640 --> 07:25.020
<b>What I told you was not the whole truth.</b>

07:25.110 --> 07:30.400
<b>My forebears' prophecy
does not speak only of the child,</b>

07:31.030 --> 07:33.070
<b>but of her power.</b>

07:33.160 --> 07:35.910
<b>The power that grows inside her.</b>

07:35.990 --> 07:39.080
<b>Too quickly
for her mortal husk to contain.</b>

07:39.830 --> 07:41.580
<b>It consumes her.</b>

07:41.660 --> 07:44.670
<b>She needs someone to guide her.</b>

07:44.750 --> 07:47.460
<b>To help her fulfill her true purpose.</b>

07:48.050 --> 07:50.380
<b>This world is full of evils.</b>

07:50.470 --> 07:53.340
<b>Dark forces
that would seek to corrupt her.</b>

07:53.430 --> 07:54.930
<b>Exploit her.</b>

07:55.010 --> 07:56.510
<b>Destroy her.</b>

07:58.680 --> 07:59.970
<b>[whimpers]</b>

08:00.480 --> 08:01.600
<b>[groans]</b>

08:01.680 --> 08:02.980
<b>[sighs]</b>

08:03.770 --> 08:04.600
<b>[gasps softly]</b>

08:11.940 --> 08:14.700
<b>[priest] I must find the girl first.</b>

08:15.110 --> 08:17.490
<b>[Yasuke] Whatever you're gonna do to me…
[sighs]</b>

08:17.580 --> 08:18.410
<b>…do it.</b>

08:18.910 --> 08:20.870
<b>[priest laughing] I do nothing.</b>

08:24.960 --> 08:28.750
<b>It is God who guides my hands.</b>

08:28.840 --> 08:33.260
<b>They are but his unworthy instruments.</b>

08:42.810 --> 08:47.100
<b>-[Yasuke grunting]
-Where is the girl?</b>

08:47.190 --> 08:50.110
<b>-[blows landing]
-[grunting continues]</b>

08:52.110 --> 08:53.990
<b>[priest laughs]</b>

08:54.070 --> 08:56.700
<b>[Yasuke grunts]</b>

08:56.780 --> 08:58.780
<b>Your god punches like an old woman.</b>

09:01.990 --> 09:04.000
<b>-[sniffing]
-[dog barking]</b>

09:04.080 --> 09:07.040
<b>Her scent is fresh. She's here.</b>

09:07.120 --> 09:10.380
<b>If I could just get
my infrared mode to work…</b>

09:12.510 --> 09:14.510
<b>[scanner whirring]</b>

09:18.510 --> 09:20.180
<b>That's not right.</b>

09:21.010 --> 09:23.770
<b>Damn it,
now everything's in black and white.</b>

09:25.020 --> 09:26.190
<b>[gasps]</b>

09:30.110 --> 09:31.690
<b>Her trail ends right…</b>

09:36.990 --> 09:38.570
<b>[shimmering sound]</b>

09:38.660 --> 09:39.570
<b>…here.</b>

09:42.160 --> 09:44.870
<b>My fruit! My beautiful fruit!</b>

09:46.580 --> 09:48.330
<b>[thrusters whooshing]</b>

09:50.840 --> 09:52.300
<b>[Saki gasps]</b>

09:59.840 --> 10:00.760
<b>Got you.</b>

10:00.850 --> 10:03.600
<b>Don't touch me. You took my mom away.</b>

10:03.680 --> 10:04.770
<b>You're monsters!</b>

10:04.850 --> 10:07.520
<b>Oh, sweet child, you think that was us?</b>

10:09.350 --> 10:10.480
<b>I got her.</b>

10:13.940 --> 10:15.400
<b>[blaster whirring, fires]</b>

10:15.480 --> 10:16.900
<b>[Saki grunts]</b>

10:19.070 --> 10:20.620
<b>[all gasping]</b>

10:27.370 --> 10:28.500
<b>[gasping]</b>

10:28.580 --> 10:30.370
<b>[dynamic electronic music plays]</b>

10:31.040 --> 10:33.130
<b>[shouting, gasps]</b>

10:39.340 --> 10:40.890
<b>[blaster whirring, fires]</b>

10:42.140 --> 10:44.140
<b>[grunts, panting]</b>

10:46.970 --> 10:48.310
<b>Nowhere to go now.</b>

10:58.570 --> 11:00.860
<b>Okay, one where to go.</b>

11:05.580 --> 11:06.790
<b>Where is she?</b>

11:06.870 --> 11:07.870
<b>In that wagon.</b>

11:07.950 --> 11:09.620
<b>Or, uh, that one.</b>

11:09.710 --> 11:12.120
<b>Or, no, that-- No.</b>

11:13.540 --> 11:17.380
<b>-Do you smell anything?
-[Nikita] Fish. Only fish.</b>

11:17.460 --> 11:19.300
<b>So, we lost her?</b>

11:19.380 --> 11:20.800
<b>[grunts] You lost her.</b>

11:20.880 --> 11:22.340
<b>[rapid beeping]</b>

11:22.430 --> 11:24.550
<b>Ooh! My infrared's working.</b>

11:25.470 --> 11:27.720
<b>[priest panting]</b>

11:27.810 --> 11:29.560
<b>[chuckling]</b>

11:29.640 --> 11:33.100
<b>Let's see if that chastened your tongue.</b>

11:33.190 --> 11:36.690
<b>[Yasuke] I can see why
you don't have more followers… [grunts]</b>

11:36.770 --> 11:38.690
<b>…if this is what your sermons are like.</b>

11:39.320 --> 11:40.650
<b>[shouts]</b>

11:40.740 --> 11:41.610
<b>[grunts]</b>

11:46.870 --> 11:48.660
<b>[Natsumaru] Still taking it easy on me?</b>

11:48.740 --> 11:51.540
<b>When will you accept
that I'm not some helpless girl?</b>

11:55.130 --> 11:56.960
<b>[Yasuke grunts]</b>

11:57.040 --> 11:58.920
<b>[both grunting]</b>

12:02.010 --> 12:04.010
<b>[panting]</b>

12:06.850 --> 12:07.720
<b>Better?</b>

12:09.350 --> 12:10.180
<b>Yes.</b>

12:21.820 --> 12:23.860
<b>[Yasuke] Nobunaga has given our orders.</b>

12:23.950 --> 12:26.280
<b>We march to meet
the Iga Clan at first light.</b>

12:26.370 --> 12:28.120
<b>I will ride with the main force,</b>

12:28.200 --> 12:31.540
<b>crossing the mountain path
to attack Hattori Hanzo from the rear.</b>

12:34.420 --> 12:35.250
<b>Yasuke.</b>

12:35.880 --> 12:37.080
<b>[Yasuke] We should rest.</b>

12:37.670 --> 12:39.250
<b>Much depends on tomorrow.</b>

12:48.640 --> 12:49.970
<b>[crickets chirping]</b>

13:17.670 --> 13:18.580
<b>[grunts]</b>

13:18.670 --> 13:21.380
<b>Bet you half your cut
he doesn't make it to nightfall.</b>

13:21.460 --> 13:23.460
<b>-[Yasuke grunting]
-Two to one odds.</b>

13:23.550 --> 13:25.930
<b>Think I'd just throw my cash away?</b>

13:27.640 --> 13:28.470
<b>Three to one.</b>

13:30.260 --> 13:35.180
<b>Perhaps you will be moved
by a different incentive.</b>

13:38.980 --> 13:40.190
<b>[Yasuke] I feel nothing.</b>

13:40.270 --> 13:42.020
<b>You will.</b>

13:45.150 --> 13:46.320
<b>[grunts]</b>

13:47.740 --> 13:49.950
<b>[groaning]</b>

13:50.030 --> 13:51.530
<b>The preacher's a mutant.</b>

13:52.030 --> 13:54.330
<b>I mean, it explains a lot.</b>

13:54.410 --> 13:56.330
<b>-[electricity crackling]
-[Yasuke yells]</b>

13:57.080 --> 13:59.080
<b>[screaming]</b>

13:59.170 --> 14:05.090
<b>Now do you feel the gift
God has seen fit to bestow upon me?</b>

14:05.170 --> 14:09.590
<b>And this is nothing compared
to what the girl will be capable of.</b>

14:09.680 --> 14:13.470
<b>She has the potential
to wield the greatest power</b>

14:13.560 --> 14:15.220
<b>this world has known,</b>

14:15.310 --> 14:18.980
<b>and I will see her realize it!</b>

14:19.060 --> 14:20.480
<b>[screaming]</b>

14:20.560 --> 14:22.730
<b>You will tell me where she is,</b>

14:22.820 --> 14:25.570
<b>or you will be the first to burn!</b>

14:31.910 --> 14:32.780
<b>[gasps]</b>

14:34.030 --> 14:34.870
<b>[grunts]</b>

14:39.830 --> 14:40.880
<b>[sighs]</b>

14:49.510 --> 14:53.600
<b>[breathing heavily]</b>

14:54.510 --> 14:55.760
<b>[grunting]</b>

14:56.270 --> 14:57.390
<b>-[grunts]
-[blow lands]</b>

14:57.470 --> 15:01.150
<b>Ow! That hurt. I thought
you were supposed to be sick and weak.</b>

15:02.190 --> 15:03.190
<b>Ichiro!</b>

15:04.690 --> 15:06.230
<b>What are you doing here?</b>

15:06.320 --> 15:07.650
<b>[boy] Ha! We found you!</b>

15:07.740 --> 15:11.320
<b>[Ichiro] It's okay! They're on our side.
We decided to team up to find you.</b>

15:11.410 --> 15:13.910
<b>After the man in the white robe
said you were missing.</b>

15:13.990 --> 15:18.000
<b>The man in the white robe?
Stay away from him. All of you.</b>

15:18.080 --> 15:19.120
<b>He's a bad man.</b>

15:19.200 --> 15:22.040
<b>What do you mean? Yassan is the bad man.</b>

15:22.120 --> 15:23.960
<b>We know what happened, Saki.</b>

15:24.040 --> 15:26.210
<b>What Yassan did to your mom.</b>

15:26.750 --> 15:29.050
<b>-But--
-I'll avenge her for you. I swear!</b>

15:29.630 --> 15:33.140
<b>It-It's not Yassan's fault.
He protected us. It was--</b>

15:33.220 --> 15:36.760
<b>But if Yassan
didn't hurt your mom, who did?</b>

15:37.770 --> 15:39.520
<b>-Saki?
-[breath trembling]</b>

15:39.600 --> 15:41.310
<b>[gasps lightly, sharply]</b>

15:44.270 --> 15:45.310
<b>[gasps]</b>

15:46.520 --> 15:47.690
<b>Saki?</b>

15:49.070 --> 15:51.070
<b>[gasps, panting]</b>

15:54.160 --> 15:56.080
<b>-[panicked breaths]
-[boys gasping]</b>

15:59.790 --> 16:00.750
<b>[groans]</b>

16:00.830 --> 16:01.790
<b>[grunts]</b>

16:04.540 --> 16:05.420
<b>[sighs]</b>

16:06.420 --> 16:07.340
<b>Ichi!</b>

16:07.880 --> 16:08.710
<b>[boys gasp]</b>

16:08.800 --> 16:09.670
<b>What did you…?</b>

16:10.920 --> 16:13.880
<b>No, I-I-- I didn't. I swear.</b>

16:16.680 --> 16:18.100
<b>[Ichiro groans softly]</b>

16:18.180 --> 16:20.060
<b>[gasping lightly]</b>

16:22.180 --> 16:24.190
<b>[bird calling in distance]</b>

16:30.190 --> 16:31.900
<b>[breathing heavily]</b>

16:32.650 --> 16:33.610
<b>[sighs]</b>

16:38.700 --> 16:41.200
<b>-[electricity crackling]
-[Yasuke groaning]</b>

16:43.660 --> 16:46.580
<b>[yelling]</b>

16:47.750 --> 16:49.590
<b>[Yasuke grunting]</b>

16:51.670 --> 16:53.300
<b>[screaming]</b>

16:53.380 --> 16:55.340
<b>-[woman] What are you--
-[Yasuke shouts]</b>

16:56.550 --> 16:57.970
<b>[Yasuke moans]</b>

16:58.050 --> 16:59.350
<b>[grunts]</b>

17:01.180 --> 17:02.850
<b>You know this means the bet is off.</b>

17:03.520 --> 17:06.440
<b>You dare interrupt God's work?</b>

17:06.520 --> 17:08.110
<b>You're wasting time.</b>

17:08.190 --> 17:09.770
<b>The old man knows nothing.</b>

17:09.860 --> 17:12.570
<b>Let's be done with him
and complete our business.</b>

17:12.650 --> 17:13.650
<b>[woman scoffs]</b>

17:13.740 --> 17:16.610
<b>-He might already be done with.
-[man] Just as well.</b>

17:16.700 --> 17:18.780
<b>Saves me cleaning my knife after.</b>

17:20.160 --> 17:22.620
<b>[weakly] Forgive me… Natsumaru.</b>

17:32.090 --> 17:33.960
<b>This is the whole of our force?</b>

17:40.760 --> 17:42.140
<b>[Nobunaga laughs]</b>

17:42.220 --> 17:47.140
<b>Hattori Hanzo,
slippery as an eel in otter shit.</b>

17:47.230 --> 17:49.860
<b>He comes to surprise us in the pass.</b>

17:49.940 --> 17:51.770
<b>Just as you said he would.</b>

17:54.990 --> 17:56.900
<b>[rumbling]</b>

17:58.990 --> 18:00.160
<b>[in Japanese] Attack!</b>

18:00.240 --> 18:03.160
<b>[all shouting]</b>

18:03.240 --> 18:05.160
<b>[clamor of battle]</b>

18:08.670 --> 18:13.340
<b>[men grunting]</b>

18:25.470 --> 18:28.980
<b>[grunting]</b>

18:30.310 --> 18:32.310
<b>[rhythmic, mellow music playing]</b>

18:34.270 --> 18:35.820
<b>[grunting]</b>

18:40.860 --> 18:42.160
<b>[both grunt]</b>

18:46.290 --> 18:48.120
<b>You knew that Hanzo would be here.</b>

18:48.210 --> 18:52.040
<b>Because you told him where to be.
That pendant you wear.</b>

18:52.130 --> 18:56.260
<b>I saw another with the same symbol
on the neck of the Iga general I killed.</b>

18:56.340 --> 19:01.390
<b>So, this is the way of the Onna Bugeisha.
Fighting by treachery, without honor.</b>

19:01.470 --> 19:04.050
<b>[Natsumaru] I was never an Onna Bugeisha.</b>

19:04.140 --> 19:06.270
<b>I am Hattori Hanzo's besshikime.</b>

19:06.770 --> 19:09.020
<b>A warrior in his personal guard.</b>

19:10.690 --> 19:14.690
<b>Yasuke,
I acted only out of loyalty to my clan.</b>

19:14.770 --> 19:16.150
<b>My true clan.</b>

19:16.230 --> 19:20.490
<b>A spy and her mark.
That's all we've ever been to each other.</b>

19:21.530 --> 19:22.450
<b>[Natsumaru shouts]</b>

19:22.530 --> 19:24.200
<b>[both grunting]</b>

19:25.030 --> 19:25.910
<b>[Yasuke grunts]</b>

19:27.540 --> 19:28.450
<b>[gasps]</b>

19:28.540 --> 19:29.540
<b>[groaning]</b>

19:34.540 --> 19:35.670
<b>Not all.</b>

19:39.920 --> 19:42.090
<b>[clamor of battle continues]</b>

19:48.560 --> 19:50.480
<b>[flames crackling]</b>

19:59.070 --> 20:01.570
<b>[ominous music plays]</b>

20:18.630 --> 20:20.630
<b>[ethereal music plays]</b>

20:51.120 --> 20:53.120
<b>-[music fades]
-[crickets chirping]</b>

20:53.210 --> 20:55.420
<b>-[moans]
-[robot] What do we do with her now?</b>

20:55.500 --> 20:57.880
<b>-[gasps]
-[Nikita] Bring her to the preacher.</b>

20:57.960 --> 21:01.130
<b>Tell him price stays the same,
regardless of damages.</b>

21:04.420 --> 21:06.640
<b>[shimmering sound]</b>

21:06.720 --> 21:07.550
<b>Huh?</b>

21:07.640 --> 21:09.050
<b>[shouts, grunts]</b>

21:12.890 --> 21:13.730
<b>[grunts]</b>

21:14.890 --> 21:15.730
<b>[scoffs]</b>

21:17.810 --> 21:19.610
<b>Where is the preacher?</b>

21:22.320 --> 21:26.610
<b>The Lord sends his signs
even through the lowest of heathens.</b>

21:28.950 --> 21:32.370
<b>Ensure that the boatsman is dead,
then dispose of him.</b>

21:32.450 --> 21:35.160
<b>He has been judged and condemned.</b>

21:35.710 --> 21:37.710
<b>[footsteps receding]</b>

21:43.710 --> 21:47.130
<b>Sorry, old man. You had some fight in you.</b>

21:47.220 --> 21:48.390
<b>[loud crash]</b>

21:57.520 --> 22:00.650
<b>At last! You've brought her to me.</b>

22:00.730 --> 22:02.270
<b>She brought us.</b>

22:07.650 --> 22:09.410
<b>-[whooshing]
-Huh?</b>

22:13.830 --> 22:14.660
<b>[grunts]</b>

22:14.750 --> 22:16.620
<b>[crackling]</b>

22:18.250 --> 22:20.170
<b>-[grunts]
-[shimmering sound]</b>

22:25.260 --> 22:26.670
<b>[loud crash]</b>

22:31.090 --> 22:32.180
<b>[birds squawking]</b>

22:32.260 --> 22:34.180
<b>[panting]</b>

22:34.260 --> 22:36.560
<b>Impressive.</b>

22:37.140 --> 22:40.440
<b>Imagine what you could do
with proper instruction.</b>

22:41.610 --> 22:43.690
<b>Come back home with me.</b>

22:43.770 --> 22:46.230
<b>That place will never be my home.</b>

22:46.320 --> 22:50.700
<b>And I'm gonna use them to make sure
you can't hurt anyone else. Ever!</b>

22:54.410 --> 22:55.490
<b>[grunts]</b>

22:56.450 --> 22:57.370
<b>[gasps]</b>

23:00.500 --> 23:01.380
<b>[grunts]</b>

23:03.460 --> 23:06.760
<b>I wanted my children to be gifted.</b>

23:10.550 --> 23:12.260
<b>[straining, sighs]</b>

23:14.390 --> 23:16.180
<b>[grunts, gasping]</b>

23:16.260 --> 23:19.180
<b>Doesn't every father?</b>

23:19.270 --> 23:21.190
<b>-[electricity crackling]
-[screams]</b>

23:25.770 --> 23:27.820
<b>[screaming]</b>

23:27.900 --> 23:29.070
<b>[panting]</b>

23:31.150 --> 23:33.160
<b>But I have you now.</b>

23:33.240 --> 23:38.580
<b>And I will see you purged
of all the devil's influences.</b>

23:40.040 --> 23:41.160
<b>[grunts softly]</b>

23:42.170 --> 23:45.090
<b>-[electricity crackling]
-[screaming]</b>

23:46.210 --> 23:47.090
<b>Saki!</b>

23:50.170 --> 23:55.720
<b>Accept the light of the Lord inside you!</b>

23:56.300 --> 23:57.350
<b>[straining]</b>

23:57.430 --> 23:58.850
<b>[growling]</b>

23:58.930 --> 24:00.350
<b>[screaming]</b>

24:00.430 --> 24:02.560
<b>[straining]</b>

24:02.640 --> 24:04.100
<b>-[screaming]
-[grunts]</b>

24:06.940 --> 24:08.940
<b>[straining]</b>

24:10.940 --> 24:11.860
<b>[loud crack]</b>

24:14.450 --> 24:16.200
<b>[growling]</b>

24:16.280 --> 24:18.620
<b>-[roars]
-[gasps]</b>

24:25.330 --> 24:26.250
<b>[rumbling]</b>

24:30.840 --> 24:31.970
<b>[Saki] No!</b>

24:33.630 --> 24:35.300
<b>[groans]</b>

24:44.270 --> 24:46.310
<b>[groaning softly]</b>

24:55.280 --> 24:58.700
<b>[clinking]</b>

25:01.540 --> 25:03.370
<b>[woman] How do we get paid now?</b>

25:04.210 --> 25:05.080
<b>[man] Like this.</b>

25:08.170 --> 25:10.460
<b>[mellow music playing]</b>

25:10.550 --> 25:11.590
<b>And these two?</b>

25:14.510 --> 25:15.680
<b>No concern of ours.</b>

25:17.470 --> 25:19.220
<b>[Yasuke grunting softly]</b>

25:31.730 --> 25:33.690
<b>Thanks for hesitating to kill me.</b>

25:38.450 --> 25:40.120
<b>If I see you again--</b>

25:40.200 --> 25:41.330
<b>Likewise.</b>

26:04.810 --> 26:08.190
<b>So, a new power arises.</b>

26:09.520 --> 26:12.520
<b>Like a brilliant gold flame.</b>

26:21.320 --> 26:23.660
<b>["Between Memories"
by Flying Lotus playing]</b>

26:41.600 --> 26:43.220
<b>[girl laughing]</b>

26:43.310 --> 26:46.680
<b>♪ I want in, not waiting ♪</b>

26:47.180 --> 26:49.310
<b>♪ We're out to leave now ♪</b>

26:49.390 --> 26:53.940
<b>♪ Don't worry 'bout the weather
We're setting out together ♪</b>

26:54.020 --> 26:57.400
<b>♪ I want in, not waiting ♪</b>

26:57.900 --> 27:00.030
<b>♪ We're out to leave now ♪</b>

27:00.110 --> 27:04.490
<b>♪ Don't worry 'bout the weather
We're setting out together ♪</b>

27:04.990 --> 27:07.000
<b>[female vocalizing]</b>

27:09.960 --> 27:11.370
<b>[indistinct chatter]</b>

27:13.130 --> 27:15.630
<b>-[female vocalizing]
-♪ Come on ♪</b>

27:23.390 --> 27:25.260
<b>[girl laughing]</b>

27:25.350 --> 27:26.560
<b>♪ Come on ♪</b>

27:30.060 --> 27:32.060
<b>[girl laughing]</b>
